<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36078" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Phlĕgĕthon</span></b> ,
		ontis, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φλεγέθων</span> (burning, blazing), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a river in the Lower World</i>, <i>which ran with fire instead of water</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Chaos et Phlegethon loca nocte silentia late,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 6, 265</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tartareus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 6, 551</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 4, 522</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ardenti freto Phlegethon harenas igneus tostas
					agens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Thyest. 1018</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Oedip. 162</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Agam. 752</span></i>. —Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Phlĕgĕthontēus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>Phlegethontian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ripa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Rapt. Pros. 1, 88</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Phlĕgĕthontis</span></b> ,
			ĭdis, f.
			adj., <i>Phlegethontian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">unda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 15, 532</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lympha,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 5, 544</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
